<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\パフェ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\パフェ全体.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Thank you for waiting. The spring strawberry parfait."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> had a gigantic parfait set down right in front of her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ohoo! Here it is, here it is! I feel a bit bad about this, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> changed her expression in an instant and was admiring the parfait happily.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Ah, no, no... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">have as much as you like."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> started with the cookie on the very top.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Being able to switch her behavior in an instant, whatever the mood in the room: that is the amazing thing about <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\ポリポリ食べる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mmm! So crunchy, so crisp! The cookie on top of a parfait really does have to be eaten before it goes </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="しけ">soggy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I must say!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a sidelong glance at the two of us, frozen at hearing about a flayed body, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> drove her long thin spoon all the way down to the bottom of the parfait.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"H-haha... I'm glad you're pleased..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
But my head was occupied by something else.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤人.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A bright red corpse, dying under a cherry tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's exactly the dream I had just now...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be that that dream and this incident are connected somehow―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are you all right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> took a bright red strawberry and
{PLAYSND "SE\ガブリ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
 bit into it with a chomp.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s mouth let out a thin trickle of red strawberry juice.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, just going to the restroom..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, are you all right? Shall I come with you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No, I'm doing well today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I stood up, I forced a smile at her.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "6" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ファミレストイレ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I went into the restroom and let out a long breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A bright red corpse, and still conscious even so...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> has an innocent, cheerful face, and a very good head on her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> is a lump of curiosity and drive, but twice as considerate and kind as anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And me...<PG>
I probably have no outward individuality at all, apart from hating cherry trees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My grades middle of the middle, my sports lower of the middle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, I do have one strange trait.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It is intuition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am abnormally strong in intuition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To put it more concretely, my sensing of danger is good to an uncanny degree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Enough, by now, to be called precognition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Many times before now I have sensed some danger and escaped harm.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\草むら.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
For instance, last spring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> was about to step into the long grass, and I stopped her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マムシ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
If <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> had taken one more step then, she would have trodden on the pit viper that was there and been bitten.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were others: <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>'s traffic accident, and <STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE>'s train accident away on a business trip.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were several for myself as well.<PG>
If you call it coincidence then coincidence settles it, and to call it a trait of mine is an exaggeration.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, <STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> all know the power of my intuition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So they take my warnings at face value.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢桜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And one more strange thing: this intuition works only at this time of year, while the cherries are in bloom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only, the cherries being in bloom does not mean I can always sense danger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are times when I can sense it and cases when I cannot.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\夢の目.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And then that dream just now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s reasoning seemed to have something to do with it, somehow...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried to remember more of that dream.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢桜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤人.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A bright red person was lying there, asking me for help.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then a rain of blood began to fall from the cherry tree, and my ankle was seized.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the end that person shouted at me, and the dream ended.<PG>
............
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, that's wrong. I am misunderstanding something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something is not meshing properly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ファミレストイレ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Whew..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took one more big, deep breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll ask <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> about the dream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She might be able to analyze it well.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
